# .dockerignore — the study-api image (apps/study-api/Dockerfile) needs
# exactly two things from the repo root: the Go module and the content
# library. Everything else in the tree was riding the build context on
# every deploy — 1.5GB+ of node_modules, the static export, the mobile
# app, .git — which is why Render deploys crawled. Trim to the bone.

# Version control + CI
.git
.github
.gitignore

# The web workspace (built by Vercel, never by Docker)
apps/web
node_modules
**/node_modules

# The mobile app
apps/mobile

# Repo docs, scripts, tooling
*.md
docs
scripts
tools
uploads
correction
legacy
render.yaml
vercel.json
turbo.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml
package.json
tsconfig.base.json
